{"id":"3413562300b98864","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-variablepolarity.md","title":"Variable polarity","display":"df-variablepolarity — Variable polarity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-variablepolarity","aliases":["27-df-variablepolarity"],"display":"df-variablepolarity — Variable polarity","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-variablepolarity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-variablepolarity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variablepolarity — Variable polarity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a[i\\leftarrow c]\">\\(a[i\\leftarrow c]\\)</span> 由下式逐输入定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosVar}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PosVar}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NegVar}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{NegVar}_n\\)</span> 是定义于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times[n]\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times[n]\\)</span> 的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a[i\\leftarrow c]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle j,b\\rangle\\in[n]\\times\\mathbb B\\mid(j=i\\land b=c)\\lor(j\\neq i\\land b=a_j)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ i\\in[n],\\ c\\in\\mathbb B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a[i\\leftarrow c]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle j,b\\rangle\\in[n]\\times\\mathbb B\\mid(j=i\\land b=c)\\lor(j\\neq i\\land b=a_j)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ i\\in[n],\\ c\\in\\mathbb B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosVar}_n(f,i)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a[i\\leftarrow0])\\le f(a[i\\leftarrow1])),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NegVar}_n(f,i)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a[i\\leftarrow0])\\ge f(a[i\\leftarrow1]))\n\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\ i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PosVar}_n(f,i)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a[i\\leftarrow0])\\le f(a[i\\leftarrow1])),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NegVar}_n(f,i)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a[i\\leftarrow0])\\ge f(a[i\\leftarrow1]))\n\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\ i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §1.10.1, Definition 1.24，印刷页 34，PDF 第 58 页（从 1 计数）。 无关变量同时满足正极性和负极性。坐标更新现在由 Assertion 的函数图构造确定；两个分支互斥且覆盖 [n]，其结果唯一且仍属于布尔立方体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]。对 $a\\in\\mathbb B^n$、$i\\in[n]$、$c\\in\\mathbb B$，$a[i\\leftarrow c]$ 由下式逐输入定义。$\\mathrm{PosVar}_n$、$\\mathrm{NegVar}_n$ 是定义于 $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times[n]$ 的谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"a[i\\leftarrow c]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PosVar}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NegVar}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\times[n]","display":false},{"tex":"a[i\\leftarrow c]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle j,b\\rangle\\in[n]\\times\\mathbb B\\mid(j=i\\land b=c)\\lor(j\\neq i\\land b=a_j)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ i\\in[n],\\ c\\in\\mathbb B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PosVar}_n(f,i)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a[i\\leftarrow0])\\le f(a[i\\leftarrow1])),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NegVar}_n(f,i)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a[i\\leftarrow0])\\ge f(a[i\\leftarrow1]))\n\\quad(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\ i\\in[n]).","display":true}],"bytes":1411,"backlinks":[{"id":"d8bd90c8ba3abfd1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PosVar}_n$ and $\\mathrm{NegVar}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-variablepolarity]]."},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-363","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-variablepolarity|df-variablepolarity — Variable polarity]]"},{"id":"200e7013fdc02d77","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$i\\in[n]$；$c_j$ 与 $\\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}$ 见 [[27-df-chow]]，$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dual]]，同维坐标更新 $x[i\\leftarrow b]$ 见 [[27-df-variablepolarity]]。$\\pi_j:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathbb Z$（$0\\le j\\le n$）、$\\delta_i:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb Z$ 和 $f^d\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 由下式构造。"},{"id":"84d29f643f27eadc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$，$(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)$，$i\\in[n]$；见 [[27-df-threshold]]。布尔坐标更新 $x[i\\leftarrow b]$ 见 [[27-df-variablepolarity]]。$\\mathrm{Ess}_i(f),\\mathrm{Pos}_i(f),\\mathrm{Neg}_i(f)$、$N\\subseteq[n]$、$w^{i\\leftarrow0}\\in\\mathbb R^n$、$\\sigma_N:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B^n$ 与 $g:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式定义。"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817"]}